{"2608600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Ape Tales: An Epic Adventure Game", "steam_appid": 2608600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5015920], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/4f0907494ea8b5cb7ecc36ad5d5e6721.avif?t=1786556715\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ape Tales: An Epic Adventure Game</strong><br>Humanity brought the world to ruin. Now, the fate of the animal kingdom rests in the hands of... one extraordinarily determined ape! The Ape Tales is a dynamic platformer that fuses the magic of retro classics with modern gameplay mechanics. Travel through time—from the age of dinosaurs to a cybernetic future—upgrade your arsenal, and battle relentless armies to become a living legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/3fae2720df6e5b4ad7ddb6b331f3c473.avif?t=1786556715\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras_big/3fae2720df6e5b4ad7ddb6b331f3c473.avif?t=1786556715 width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humanity Failed. Welcome to the Age of the Ape!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world fell to human greed, and from the ashes of the old civilisation, a new evil has emerged. Rise as the ultimate beacon of hope for the animal kingdom and embark on an epic journey across time to put an end to the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ape Tales</strong> is a love letter to the golden era of platformers, powered up with modern character progression, dynamic combat, and a richly diverse world to explore.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/f1de7a0ba51e265f4a18cd0bb81520e8.avif?t=1786556715\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras_big/f1de7a0ba51e265f4a18cd0bb81520e8.avif?t=1786556715 width=800 height=248 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the greatest adventure of your life in your style!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade your weapon, change your look and choose your ability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot the bananas, shurikens and change your appearance to a knight ape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new abilities to become more powerful than you can imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/d360f4d775aaa8edd222f68fffc73199.avif?t=1786556715\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras_big/d360f4d775aaa8edd222f68fffc73199.avif?t=1786556715 width=800 height=268 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ape Tales: An Epic Adventure Game</strong> key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Time-Bending Worlds:</strong> Traverse over 12 unique maps—from prehistoric jungles and sun-drenched islands to medieval castles and dark, futuristic metropolises. Travel from prehistoric to the future world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Relentless Enemies &amp; Epic Bosses:</strong> Battle over 35 distinct enemy types! Knights, aliens, pirates, deadly robots, and dinosaurs are just the beginning. Face a formidable boss at the end of every world that will test your skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍌 <strong>Customizable Combat &amp; Style:</strong> Fight your way! Toss explosive bananas, hurl ninja shurikens, or suit up as a heavy knight ape. Collect tokens to buy lethal weapons, unlock game-changing abilities, and customize your look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Rich Story &amp; Hidden Secrets:</strong> Meet quirky dwellers across different eras, fulfill side quests, uncover hidden secrets, and unlock the true epilogue to complete your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much... much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/03f2870ca30c28ada0aaeb3bbfea9092.poster.avif?t=1786556715\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/03f2870ca30c28ada0aaeb3bbfea9092.webm?t=1786556715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/03f2870ca30c28ada0aaeb3bbfea9092.mp4?t=1786556715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover Secrets, Power Up, and Save the World!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level in <i>The Ape Tales</i> brings new mechanics, fresh challenges, and a distinct atmosphere. Do you have what it takes to leap through time and rewrite history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the adventure and add <i>The Ape Tales</i> to your Steam Wishlist today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/4f8bfb362d89e729ec22e60044ddbd2d.poster.avif?t=1786556715\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608600/extras/4f8bfb362d89e729ec22e60044ddbd2d.webm?t=1786556715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic